MENTOR: We'll work on Title. This is your comp at 1 s, partway through its first move.

From 0.5 s to 1.5 s Title moves at one speed the whole way, then stops dead at 3 s: that's linear, and it's why it looks mechanical. Easing slows it down as it leaves each keyframe and as it arrives at the next. With Title's keys showing (U), select both keys of a pair and choose **Animation > Keyframe Assistant > Easy Ease** (F9); the diamonds turn into hourglasses.

Ease Title's two Position moves (0.5 s to 1.5 s and 1.5 s to 3 s), its Scale and its Opacity (both 0.5 s to 1.5 s), then say "done". If you'd like to watch me do one pair first, just ask.

